<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Waters to swim in is flowing toward the east,</l><l>Water is flowing to glory that we seek;</l><l>Having the preeminence in life, work and home,</l><l>The church life is a life-flow from which we never roam.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
